    "bodyJa": "I asked people what they’re doing to make life more affordable today. I’ll definitely be trying some of these.",
    "source": "MarketWatch",
    "sourceUrl": "https://www.marketwatch.com/story/money-saving-hacks-to-cope-with-higher-prices-from-our-readers-a092767e?mod=mw_rss_topstories",
    "publishedAt": "2026-10-24T15:27:00+00:00",
